1
00:00:01,950 --> 00:00:03,575
After days without sleep,

2
00:00:03,375 --> 00:00:04,890
your brain can start showing

3
00:00:04,690 --> 00:00:06,425
you things that aren't there.

4
00:00:06,775 --> 00:00:07,820
But that's not even the

5
00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:09,134
first thing that goes wrong.

6
00:00:09,684 --> 00:00:11,378
After 24 hours awake,

7
00:00:11,178 --> 00:00:12,600
your attention,

8
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:13,483
judgment,

9
00:00:13,283 --> 00:00:15,112
and reaction time can become

10
00:00:14,912 --> 00:00:16,606
seriously impaired.

11
00:00:17,106 --> 00:00:18,220
By 48 hours,

12
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:20,569
microsleeps can interrupt your awareness

13
00:00:20,369 --> 00:00:21,874
for a few seconds,

14
00:00:21,674 --> 00:00:24,159
sometimes without you realizing it.

15
00:00:24,659 --> 00:00:26,167
After several days,

16
00:00:25,967 --> 00:00:27,039
confusion,

17
00:00:26,839 --> 00:00:28,533
distorted perception,

18
00:00:28,333 --> 00:00:30,651
and even hallucinations can occur.

19
00:00:31,151 --> 00:00:32,445
By day seven,

20
00:00:32,245 --> 00:00:35,144
severe cognitive impairment and dangerous

21
00:00:34,944 --> 00:00:37,041
lapses in awareness could make

22
00:00:36,841 --> 00:00:39,156
ordinary activities unsafe.

23
00:00:39,906 --> 00:00:41,144
And the frightening part?

24
00:00:41,274 --> 00:00:42,656
You may not fully realize

25
00:00:42,456 --> 00:00:44,175
how impaired you've become.

